  "description": "Shourya Hackathon is the flagship 27-hour technical hackathon of Shourya at MVSR Engineering College (MVSREC), Hyderabad. Event Highlights & Schedule: Dates: Day 1 & Day 2 (16th & 17th October 2026) Timings: 10:00 AM (Day 1) to 1:00 PM (Day 2) – 27-hour continuous hackathon Venue: CSE 4 LABS, MVSR Engineering College Guidelines & Eligibility: Open to all undergraduate and postgraduate college students. Teams of 2 to 4 members. Inter-college and inter-specialization teams are allowed. Problem statements across Web3, AI/ML, Cloud, HealthTech, and Open Innovation. Hardware/software environments, Wi-Fi, power backup, and lab facilities provided in CSE 4 Labs. Evaluation criteria: Innovation, Technical Complexity, Practical Feasibility, UI/UX, and Final Pitch. Win exciting cash prizes, certificates, and recognition!",
