    "details": "<p><strong>Shourya Hackathon</strong> is the flagship 27-hour technical hackathon of Shourya at MVSR Engineering College (MVSREC), Hyderabad.</p>\n<p><strong>Event Highlights &amp; Schedule:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Dates:</strong> Day 1 &amp; Day 2 (16th &amp; 17th October 2026)</li>\n<li><strong>Timings:</strong> 10:00 AM (Day 1) to 1:00 PM (Day 2) &ndash; 27-hour continuous hackathon</li>\n<li><strong>Venue:</strong> CSE 4 LABS, MVSR Engineering College</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Guidelines &amp; Eligibility:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open to all undergraduate and postgraduate college students.</li>\n<li>Teams of 2 to 4 members. Inter-college and inter-specialization teams are allowed.</li>\n<li>Problem statements across Web3, AI/ML, Cloud, HealthTech, and Open Innovation.</li>\n<li>Hardware/software environments, Wi-Fi, power backup, and lab facilities provided in CSE 4 Labs.</li>\n<li>Evaluation criteria: Innovation, Technical Complexity, Practical Feasibility, UI/UX, and Final Pitch.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Win exciting cash prizes, certificates, and recognition!</p>",
